## WordPress Website-Building Plugins

- [BlockSpare](https://blockspare.com/): An AF Themes WordPress plugin providing Gutenberg blocks, patterns, sections, and starter templates for building news, magazine, blog, and business websites.
- [EleSpare](https://elespare.com/): An AF Themes WordPress plugin providing Elementor widgets, templates, template kits, and header/footer building tools for publishers, blogs, news, magazine, and business websites.
- [TemplateSpare](https://templatespare.com/): An AF Themes WordPress plugin providing starter templates and full-site migration tools.
- [AF Companion](https://wordpress.org/plugins/af-companion/): An AF Themes WordPress plugin providing website-building tools and starter-site importing functionality, particularly for news and magazine websites.
- [AF Translate](https://wordpress.org/plugins/af-translate/): An AF Themes WordPress plugin for translating WordPress themes and plugins using AI and translation services.
- [WP Post Author](https://wordpress.org/plugins/wp-post-author/): An AF Themes WordPress plugin providing author profiles, author boxes, co-authors, guest authors, post ratings, and related publishing features.

